Put your picture files in this folder (e.g. drag-race-uk-hero.jpg).

Then in articles.json, reference them like:

  "image": "images/drag-race-uk-hero.jpg"

Recommended size: at least 1200px wide, roughly a 16:10 or 3:2 shape works best
with the card layout. JPG or PNG both work.

If an article's "image" field is left as an empty string (""), the site shows
a soft placeholder block using the story's category colour instead of a broken image.
